(2, 3, 1, 2, 'Junior Back-End Developer', '', 'Rustenburg', 'We are seeking a Junior Back End Developer skilled in .NET Core, Microservices, and Kafka. You will build and maintain scalable APIs and backend services for high-performance systems.', '• Degree in Computer Science\r\n• 2 years of work experience', '• Develop and maintain RESTful APIs and backend services\r\n• Implement event-driven architecture using Kafka or RabbitMQ\r\n• Optimize performance and scalability of backend systems\r\n• Collaborate with DevOps and QA teams for CI/CD and testing\r\n• Ensure secure coding practices and data integrity', '• Communication, Problem-Solving, C++, Python', 30000.00, NULL, '2025-10-07 08:04:38', 'Active', '{\"required_skills\":[\"Excellent Communication\",\"Problem-Solving\",\"Team Player\",\"c++\",\"Python\",\"Java\"],\"province\":\"North West\",\"city_town\":\"Rustenburg\",\"min_age\":18,\"max_age\":55}'),
(4, 3, 2, 4, 'Junior Electrical Engineer', '', 'Kempton Park', 'Our client is a leader in renewable energy solutions, delivering innovative solar power projects that drive a sustainable future. Their team is passionate about clean energy, technical excellence, and making a real impact on communities and the environment.', '• Bachelor’s Degree in Electrical Engineering (BEng/BSc) – Master’s Degree is an advantage.\r\n• Professional registration (Pr Eng / eligible) preferred.\r\n• 2+ years’ experience in solar PV electrical design and engineering.\r\n• Strong knowledge of solar PV systems, inverters, transformers, grid connection, and SCADA systems.', '• Lead electrical design and engineering for utility-scale and C&I solar PV projects.\r\n• Prepare and review single-line diagrams, electrical layouts, and system specifications.\r\n• Conduct detailed yield assessments and system performance modelling.\r\n• Oversee compliance with national and international electrical standards.\r\n• Provide technical leadership during procurement, construction, and commissioning.\r\n• Mentor and guide Junior Engineers.\r\n• Collaborate with Project Managers, Civil Engineers, and other stakeholders to ensure integrated project delivery.', 'PVSyst, AutoCAD, ETAP, Excellent problem-solving, communication,  leadership skills.', 25000.00, NULL, '2025-10-20 08:51:31', 'Active', '{\"required_skills\":[\"AutoCAD\",\"ETAP\",\"problem-solving\",\"communication\",\"leadership\",\"eager to learn\",\"PVSyst\"],\"province\":\"Gauteng\",\"min_age\":18,\"max_age\":55}'),
(5, 3, 1, 1, 'Software Developer', '', 'Pretoria', 'We are seeking a Senior Back End Developer skilled in .NET Core, Microservices, and Kafka. You will build and maintain scalable APIs and backend services for high-performance systems.', '• Degree in IT (Software Development)\r\n• 2 years of work experience', '• Develop and maintain RESTful APIs and backend services\r\n• Implement event-driven architecture using Kafka or RabbitMQ\r\n• Optimize performance and scalability of backend systems\r\n• Collaborate with DevOps and QA teams for CI/CD and testing\r\n• Ensure secure coding practices and data integrity', '• PHP, Python, SQL, JavaScript, React JS', 30000.00, NULL, '2026-01-12 11:14:36', 'Active', '{\"required_skills\":[\"Communication\",\"Problem-Solving\",\"PHP\",\"React\",\"Java\",\"Python\"],\"province\":\"Gauteng\",\"city_town\":\"Pretoria\",\"min_age\":18,\"max_age\":55}'),
(7, 3, 1, 1, 'Junior Web Developer', '', 'Rustenburg', 'Our client, a dynamic software development firm, is looking for an enthusiastic and motivated Junior Web Developer to join their team in Rustenburg, North West, ZA . This is an excellent opportunity for a recent graduate or early-career professional looking to gain hands-on experience in full-stack web development. You will work under the guidance of senior developers, contributing to the design, development, testing, and deployment of web applications. Your responsibilities will include writing clean, efficient, and well-documented code for both front-end and back-end components.', ' Degree in Information Technology', 'Assist in the design and development of responsive web applications. Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code for front-end and back-end components. Collaborate with senior developers to implement new features and functionalities. Integrate front-end interfaces with server-side logic and databases. Participate in code reviews to ensure code quality and identify potential issues. Assist in troubleshooting and debugging software defects. Learn and apply new technologies and programming languages as required. Contribute to the development of APIs and database schemas. Help create and maintain technical documentation. Work with version control systems (e.g., Git) for code management. Participate in agile development processes and team meetings. Support the testing and deployment of web applications. Gain practical experience in a professional software development lifecycle. Follow coding standards and best practices. Contribute to a positive and collaborative team environment.', 'HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python, Java, PHP, SQL, Git, Strong problem-solving, Attention to detail, Good communication, teamwork skills.', 25000.00, NULL, '2026-02-06 09:57:17', 'Active', '{\"required_skills\":[\"javascript\",\"Python\",\"Java\",\"PHP\",\"SQL\",\"react\",\"Problem-Solving\",\"good communication\",\"eager to learn\"],\"province\":\"Gauteng\",\"min_age\":18,\"max_age\":35}'),
(9, 3, 1, 5, 'IT Technician', '', 'Pretoria', 'Our client is looking for a Senior IT Technician to be the technical backbone of their team—someone who\'s seen it all, fixed most of it, and can guide others through the rest. You\'ll work hands-on with enterprise infrastructure while mentoring junior techs and helping shape how their client deliver services to over 100 clients. This isn\'t a \"manage from a distance\" role—you\'ll be in the trenches, but with the authority and support to do things properly.', 'The essentials:\r\n• 10+ years in IT with deep experience across multiple domains\r\n• Expert-level knowledge of FortiGate security appliances\r\n• Strong Microsoft 365 and Azure administration skills\r\n• Solid networking fundamentals (routing, switching, firewalls, VPNs)\r\n• Hyper-V and Windows Server administration experience\r\n• Scripting/automation skills (PowerShell is a must)\r\n• A valid driver\'s licence and own transport', 'Lead the technical charge\r\n• Be the go-to expert for complex escalations across networking, security, and Microsoft environments\r\n• Design and implement solutions for clients ranging from SMBs to enterprises\r\n• Drive automation initiatives to make their team more efficient\r\n\r\nKeep the company’s infrastructure rock-solid\r\n• Manage FortiGate firewalls, MikroTik routers, and BGP configurations\r\n• Administer Hyper-V clusters and Microsoft server environments\r\n• Oversee M365 tenants—migrations, configurations, and ongoing optimisation\r\n\r\nBuild the team\r\n• Mentor junior technicians and help them level up\r\n• Create documentation that actually gets used\r\n• Contribute to the companies internal knowledge base and best practices\r\n\r\nWork with clients\r\n• Understand their business challenges and translate them into technical solutions\r\n• Be someone clients trust and want to work with', 'Communication, Problem-Solving, Hardware, Software, Networking', 30000.00, '2026-04-30 11:01:00', '2026-04-10 09:06:32', 'Active', '{\"required_skills\":[\"Communication\",\"Problem-Solving\",\"Leadership\",\"Computer Literacy\",\"Hardware\",\"Software\",\"Networking\"],\"province\":\"Gauteng\",\"city_town\":\"Pretoria\",\"min_age\":18,\"max_age\":60}');

